Consider the following custom scikit-learn transformer designed to perform target encoding on a categorical column: ```python
class NaiveTargetEncoder(BaseEstimator, TransformerMixin):
    def fit(self, X, y): self.mapping_ = X.groupby('cat')['target'].mean().to_dict()
    return self
    def transform(self, X):
        return X['cat'].map(self.mapping_)
